SkillDesc: {
	FrostVeilSkill:
		'''
		Grants you and non-PvP allied players on the same team within {0} pixels 3 orbiting frost shields each.
		Each hit consumes one shield to block damage equal to your maximum Magic Power at cast time / 20 (currently {1:0.##}), after Magic Barrier's percentage reduction.
		Each cycle lasts 60 seconds. If any shields remain at expiry, freely refill to 3 and restart the 60 seconds. Once all shields are consumed, you must cast again. Recasting refills and refreshes without stacking.
		'''
	DollControlSkill:
		'''
		Consumes 20 Magic Power to summon a bear doll that floats alongside you and stays until dismissed.
		While it is out, hold left-click to open the command wheel: Mine Blocks and Break Walls let you drag areas to mark, and their chain versions mark connected matches with a click. Mark again to erase, and right-click to stop marking.
		The doll digs out every mark with the best pickaxe or hammer in your inventory, then returns and hands over what it collected. Cancel Tasks clears all marks; Dismiss Doll ends the skill.
		'''
	RecallSkill:
		'''
		Hold left-click to select yourself or an ally within 3000 pixels; release to summon a magic circle at their feet.
		After 1.5 seconds, allies within 160 pixels of the circle travel to the selected ally's spawn, or world spawn if their bed is invalid.
		Both circles remain for 30 seconds. Approach and right-click either circle to travel for free. Recasting closes your previous pair without affecting other players' circles.
		'''
	ShardbindSkill:
		'''
		Summons 15 ice shards that hunt down an enemy near the cursor, each dealing a small area hit, then unleashes a large ice burst for {0} Ice damage in total.
		Binds the target in ice for the duration, leaving it unable to act.
		Starts sealed. Triggering a freeze unseals one use, which cannot stack. Casting still requires the cooldown to finish and seals the spell again. Unsealing does not reduce its cooldown.
		'''
	IceConeSkill:
		'''
		Fires three ice cones, each dealing {0} Ice damage and adding {1:0.###} freeze buildup.
		Reaching 100 buildup freezes the enemy for 4 seconds. Thawing starts a 60-second freeze cooldown that prevents further buildup.
		Boss parts share freeze buildup and cooldown. Triggering a freeze unseals one use of Shardbind, even during its cooldown; unused releases do not stack.
		'''
	WaterBallSkill:
		'''
		Hold to conjure a water orb, then release to launch it, dealing {0} damage.
		After traveling a certain distance, the orb bursts in a wide splash behind the target along its flight direction. At close range, it bursts in a circular splash instead.
		On hit, reduces the target's freeze cooldown by 10 seconds and Shardbind's cooldown by 8 seconds.
		'''
	WaterLaserSKill:
		'''
		Hold to channel a water beam. Every {0} seconds, consumes {3} Magic Power and deals {1} Water damage, splashing enemies near the end of the beam for {2}%.
		Deals only {4:0.#}% damage to targets not on freeze cooldown.
		On hit, reduces the target's freeze cooldown by 0.5 seconds and Shardbind's cooldown by 0.3 seconds.
		'''
	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
		Passive: Magic Missile ignores enemy defense. After hitting the same target 5 times consecutively, it deals splash damage equal to 200% of Magic Missile's damage to other nearby enemies (the main target is not affected).
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill:
		'''
		Summons a floating magic orb that follows you, up to {0} at a time.
		Each orb fires a Magic Missile at the nearest enemy, dealing {1} magic damage.
		'''
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		Elaina uses [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] to cast skills. Each point of vanilla maximum mana gained increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] by 1. Her bonus life is reduced by 50%. Each point of maximum life lost to Ashen Witch increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] by 1.

		When [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] is insufficient, she can spend 1% of her maximum life to restore 1% of her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] for casting. This is unavailable while her current life is below 10% of her maximum life.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		Requires the Ashen Witch skill to be enabled.
		Activate the barrier just before taking damage. It reduces damage based on the life lost to Ashen Witch and consumes [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] equal to the damage blocked by the barrier.
		While active, life regeneration cannot fall below 0. This effect costs no [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] and works even with an empty reserve.
		'''
	WindSlashSkill:
		'''
		Unleashes a piercing wind blade that deals {0} magic damage to every enemy in its path.
		Weaker enemies are knocked back along the blade's direction.
		'''
}

